    "note": "Version read: As Amended by House Committee of the Whole (hb2326_01); not the enrolled bill. House passed as amended 2019-03-27, 83-41; amendments made after the version read are not in the text read. Section 3 (K.S.A. 75-7c04) was added by the Committee of the Whole; age 21 struck, 18 added. Section 1(a)(4) is existing law kept (under-21 concealed carry crime), quoted for context of the (d) exemption."
